      <li>You can customize your OpenShift Container Platform configuration during installation so that your cluster coexists with existing IP address allocations and meets customized network requirements. For more information, see "Installing a cluster on {"{"}{"{"} azure_short {"}"}{"}"} with customizations".</li>
